3,"Itneg, Moyadan in Philippines people group profile | Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/19570/RP,"Most Moyadan Itneg practice swidden farming, growing rice, root crops, and vegetables, with some hunting and weaving. Families are close-knit, with elders guiding decisions. Celebrations include feasts tied to harvests and life events, featuring rice, meat, and local delicacies. Oral tradition, music, and ritual dancing remain important.","Itneg, Moyadan",Austronesian
